    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T01:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "日历上是十点，周慕青，带《周氏族谱》来做初次评估。要记什么随时发我。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 11,
     "turn_key": "9699e47d537cc4694794942a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_8bf8dcb8f59610565e1bc190",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T01:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "她到了 一个人 拎个铁皮饼干盒"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 15,
     "turn_key": "0d6853f5952d080a409301ca"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_b267aa13ef8e9651de8193d4",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:41:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "记下了：民国十九年无锡刻，后半本水渍、页粘连。别硬揭。现在干透了还是还潮？墨有没有洇？"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 15,
     "turn_key": "0d6853f5952d080a409301ca"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_2a148004b025e1aca99657f5",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:41:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "族谱 民国十九年无锡刻的 后半本水渍 页都粘一起了"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 16,
     "turn_key": "96233ce351404699f503e4ec"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_8f86438715d0951ed67f4029",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:44:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "那这本对她不是价钱的事。报价别在她讲她哥的时候插，等看完东西、她坐下来喝口水再说。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 16,
     "turn_key": "96233ce351404699f503e4ec"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_07459c6e0114e906cd0d0e59",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:44:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "她一直在说她哥 说这本是她哥留下的 没提钱"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 17,
     "turn_key": "19b3de3dfb7899e3bd1828c3"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_12a18225e1e15349ef24828b",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T06:22:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "浆糊能重调，一上午的手感调不回来才是真损失。他这会儿在外面，你别追。等他回来让他自己重调一锅，比你再说十句管用。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 17,
     "turn_key": "19b3de3dfb7899e3bd1828c3"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_4c003684b31c8935755b1df3",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T06:22:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "阿桐浆糊调稀了 一上午白干 我说他两句他摔门出去抽烟"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 18,
     "turn_key": "301ac16435e66b2552d8b0d4"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_bd755512d55841916a102122",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T12:14:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "「看情况」他自己听得懂，就是等你排时间。要去就早点定，假期的票不好买。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 18,
     "turn_key": "301ac16435e66b2552d8b0d4"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_3a20c58832a94991f354127e",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T12:14:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "回过去了 我爸说没事 就是问我十一回不回无锡 我说看情况"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 19,
     "turn_key": "e5412c00d6efb2057e8e273a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_f6c6e513a138d81916d85cfb",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T14:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "先别干刷，真是活霉一刷孢子就扬开了。取样用镊子加棉签，单独装袋。另外今早工作室湿度冲到 64，霉菌就要这个，送检前把那本单独隔开放。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 19,
     "turn_key": "e5412c00d6efb2057e8e273a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_b28d895d1cce164334a06510",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T14:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "族谱第七页 那些黑斑 我怀疑是霉 明天拍照送检"
   }
  ],
